  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven equation : 64 - 16 × 24 ÷ 96 + 10 = 58\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the mathematical signs:\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : - and +\n\n64 - 16 × 24 ÷ 96 + 10 = 58 ⇒ 64 + 16 × **24 ÷ 96**__ - 10 = 58\n\n64 + __**16 × **____0.25__ - 10 = 58\n\n__**64 + 4**__ - 10 = 58\n\n__**68 - 10**__ = 58\n\n**58 = 58 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : × and -\n\n64 - 16 × 24 ÷ 96 + 10 = 58 ⇒ 64 × 16 - **24 ÷ 96**__ + 10 = 58\n\n__**64 ×**____** 16**__ - 0.25 + 10 = 58\n\n__**1024 + 10**__ - 0.25 = 58\n\n__**1034 **____**- 0.25**__ = 58\n\n1033.75 ≠ 58 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷ and ×\n\n64 - 16 × 24 ÷ 96 + 10 = 58 ⇒ 64 - **16 ÷ 24**__ × 96 + 10 = 58\n\n64 - __0.67____** ×**____** 96**__ + 10 = 58\n\n__**64 + 10**__ - 64.32 = 58\n\n__**74 - 64.32**__ = 58\n\n9.68 ≠ 58 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ÷ and - \n\n64 - 16 × 24 ÷ 96 + 10 = 58 ⇒ **64 ÷ 16**__ × 24 - 96 + 10 = 58\n\n__**4 × 24**__ - 96 + 10 = 58\n\n__**96 + 10**__ - 96 = 58\n\n__**106 - 96**__ = 58\n\n10 ≠ 58 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
